{
    "prompt": "\"Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes.     If object is detected, move to it, take it, check its properties and perform specific task. Otherwise, scan for objects.     list of available nodes: <Action ID = MoveToObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = SpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Action ID = ScanForObjects    />\"",
